@startuml
title Acceptation / Refus d'une demande de partage

actor "Médecin concerné\n(notifié)" as Med
participant "DossierMedical\nController" as DMC
participant "ShareRequest\n(Model)" as SR
participant "DossierMedical\n(Model)" as DM
participant "DossierAutho-\nrization (Model)" as DA
participant "Notification\n(DB)" as Notif

== Visualisation des demandes reçues ==
Med -> DMC: GET /patients/{patient}/dossier
DMC -> DM: firstOrCreate(patient_id)
DMC -> SR: where('dossier_medical_id',$id)\n  ->where('to_medecin_id',Med)\n  ->orWhere('from_medecin_id',Med)\n  ->where('statut','en_attente')
DMC --> Med: Page dossier\n  avec tableau "Demandes de partage reçues"\n  + boutons Accepter / Refuser

== Acceptation ==
Med -> DMC: POST /partages/{shareRequest}/accepter
DMC -> SR: findOrFail($shareRequest)
DMC -> DMC: Vérifie que l'utilisateur n'est pas le requester
DMC -> DMC: Vérifie statut = 'en_attente'
DMC -> DM: $shareRequest->dossierMedical
DMC -> DA: firstOrCreate(\n  dossier_medical_id,\n  medecin_id=$shareRequest->to_medecin_id,\n  autorise_par=$shareRequest->from_medecin_id)
DA --> DMC: $authorization
DMC -> SR: update(['statut'=>'acceptee'])
DMC --> Med: redirect dossier\n"Demande acceptée. Dr X peut voir la section de Dr Y."

== Refus ==
Med -> DMC: POST /partages/{shareRequest}/refuser
DMC -> SR: findOrFail($shareRequest)
DMC -> DMC: Vérifie que l'utilisateur est from ou to
DMC -> DMC: Vérifie statut = 'en_attente'
DMC -> SR: update(['statut'=>'refusee'])
DMC --> Med: redirect dossier\n"Demande de partage refusée."

@enduml
